The `ctx.web` provider interface and module scaffolding (seam imports, the
`resolveOptions`/`apply` shape, and the shared status codes) are taken from the
official DeepSeek Harness provider `@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-search-deepseek`,
which is MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek. The Brave Search
implementation — request construction, response mapping across web/news/videos,
credential resolution and error handling — is original to this package, as are
the timeout, request-spacing and retry controls described in the README.

